## Verification basics

Per case, collect only what the case needs (no secrets):

- `messages_queue` — `status`, `category` (`initial`, `vendor_assignment_request`, later turns)
- `sending_message` — outbound text, `send_time`, validator score and retries
- `message_attachments` — `document_type` when relevant
- Flower and worker logs for the Celery task name in the case
- **Local MP:** the MP side of each hop — chat messages (status, documents) through the MP API or a read-only query on the local MP database
- Simulator timeline (`/__sim/runs/{id}/events`) or harness run report

When a flow crosses services, name the **hop** that failed (for example MP publish, tagging, draft approval, validator, Celery task, storage, MP attachment) and give its evidence.

**Inbound `AdditionalData` overrides** (local only): `.cursor/rules/y-vencom-rules/test/y-vencom-inbound-payload.mdc`.

